Package: ppgt
Type: Package
Title: Pooled Group Testing Design Toolkit
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("Muhammad", "Yaseen", email = "myaseen208@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Provides tools for constructing, analyzing, and comparing 
    pooled group testing designs. Includes implementations of polynomial 
    pooling, PBEST, HYPER, separable and disjunct matrices, and finite-field 
    utilities.
